@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557
skinparam activityStartColor #163E52
skinparam activityEndColor #163E52
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M10 — Invitation acceptance and subsequent scoped access
start
:CF-M10-S01\nInitiating actor\nInvited person accepts an eligible\ninvitation and requests a granted\naction; owner may later change\nmembership.;
if (CF-M10-S02\nIntended invitation/resource\ncontext is eligible for this actor?) then (yes)
:CF-M10-S03\nRecipient\nExplicitly accept intended\ninvitation;
:CF-M10-S04\nSystem\nCheck invitation eligibility and\nexact proposed resource rights;
if (CF-M10-S05\nActual scoped grant confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M10-S06\nParticipant\nRequest a particular resource\naction;
:CF-M10-S07\nSystem\nEvaluate current grant and exact\naction/resource scope;
if (CF-M10-S08\nAction currently permitted?) then (yes)
:CF-M10-S09\nSystem\nPerform intended operation within\ncurrent resource scope;
:CF-M10-S10\nSystem\nUse CF-M17 to classify actual\nresult; return only evidence-\nsupported effect;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M10-S11\nSystem\nDeny action; sign-in/invitation\ngrants no unrelated data or\nsecrets;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M10-S12\nSystem\nNo effective membership claimed;\nreport\nexpiry/denial/failure/uncertainty;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M10-S13\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
